      "goFn": "sanitizehtml.Sanitize",
      "deviation": "upstream leaves nested ALLOWED tags in place inside a completelyDiscard'd tag (its skipText flag only suppresses text), so <foo><b>y</b></foo> keeps <b>y</b>; the port discards the whole subtree, which is what the option name promises"
